We have received the surveyor report SR-2026-1187 (attached). It finds that w=
ater entered through a defective door seal on the container during heavy weat=
her, which is a carrier-side cause. It also notes that the cartons had no moi=
sture barrier, which made the damage worse.

Based on this, we withdraw our rejection and offer a settlement of 60% of the=
 claimed value: EUR 4,920 of EUR 8,200, in full and final settlement of CLM-2=
026-0912. Please confirm in writing if you accept.

Best regards,
Baltic Shipping Claims
Short-sea carrier Gdansk

-----Original Message-----
From: Katarzyna Zielinska <k.zielinska@corp-europe.example>
