We dispute your rejection of CLM-2026-0912. Our packing photos from Gdansk da=
ted 24 Sep show stretch wrap plus four corner boards on every pallet, and the=
 damage pattern (wet from the top and one side) does not fit a humidity probl=
em inside the cartons. New photos from the independent inspection in Rotterda=
m on 6 Oct are attached below.

The surveyor has taken samples and will issue a report. We ask you to hold yo=
ur decision until you have seen it. The 8,200 EUR claim stays open.

Best regards,
